== Effects ==
* While firing, Isaac has a chance to fire an additional creep shot that deals double [[damage]], [[Status Effects#Slow|slows]] enemies, and leaves a short trail of [[Creep#White Creep|white creep]] that also [[Status Effects#Slow|slows]] enemies.
** The chance is not affected by [[luck]].
** The creep shots don't take on any tear effects.
** {{Dlc|a+nr}}The creep shots are affected by [[range]] and [[shot speed]].
*** {{Dlc|r}}The creep shots are not affected by [[range]] but affected by [[shot speed]], which determines their effective range.
** Their tear sizes are not affected by their damage. They always retain their small size.
** The creep shots can be fired diagonally.
* A creep shot will also be fired in a random direction when taking damage.
* Large Zit does not fire when {{Blindfolded}}

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Brimstone}} / {{I|Chocolate Milk}} / {{i|Epic Fetus}} / {{i|Mom's Knife}} / {{i|Monstro's Lung}} / {{I|Tech X}}: Creep shots will still be fired occasionally while holding the fire button.
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}: Creep shots will occasionally be fired along with bombs.
* {{i|Ipecac}}: High tear damage from Ipecac is doubled, causing very powerful creep shots.
* {{I|Multidimensional Baby}}: Creep shots can be duplicated.
* {{i|Polyphemus}}: High tear damage from Polyphemus is doubled.
* {{i|Technology Zero}}: Creep shots will be connected to other tears via electricity.
* {{I|Urn of Souls}}: Creep shots still shoot as normal while using the urn.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|20/20}} / {{i|The Inner Eye}} / {{i|Mutant Spider}}: Isaac will still fire one creep shot.
* {{I|Bird's Eye}} / {{I|Ghost Pepper}}: Firing creep shots does not spawn the fires.
* {{i|Compound Fracture}} / {{i|Cricket's Body}} / {{i|The Parasite}}: Creep shots will not burst into split tears.
* {{I|Dead Eye}}: Creep shots do not grant or reset the damage multiplier, although their damage still benefit from the multiplier.
* {{I|Eye of Belial}}: Creep shots are not affected.
* {{I|Eye of Greed}} / {{I|Lead Pencil}}: Creep shots are not counted for shots fired.
* {{I|Eye of the Occult}}: Creep shots are not controlled. Creep shots will only fire in cardinal or diagonal directions unless there is a cross-hair, in which case creep shots will fire directly toward it.
* {{i|Incubus}} / {{I|Twisted Pair}}: The familiars does not fire creep shots.
* {{I|Immaculate Heart}}: Firing creep shots does not spawn the orbiting tear.
* {{I|Lachryphagy}}: Creep shots are not affected from Lachryphagy, but Lachryphagy tears can feed on them.
* {{i|The Ludovico Technique}}: Movable tear behaves as normal. Isaac will occasionally fire a creep shot while moving the tear, and creep shots will only fire in cardinal or diagonal directions.
* {{I|A Lump of Coal}}: Creep shots are not affected.
* {{I|My Reflection}} / {{I|Tiny Planet}} / {{I|Tractor Beam}}: Creep shots are not affected by the trajectory altering effect. Stat changes are applied as normal.
* {{I|Pop!}}: Creep shots are not affected. Pop! tears do not bounce off of creep shots.
* {{I|Proptosis}}: Creep shots are not affected.

